    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in either player's Fight phase, right after an enemy unit selects its targets, on one **CELESTIAN SACRESANTS** unit picked as the target of at least one of its attacks.\n\nFor the rest of the phase, attacks against your unit get -1 to their **Hit rolls**. If the target is Righteous, you may also pick a second **CELESTIAN SACRESANTS** unit of yours that is:\n\n- not currently **Battle-shocked**\n- no more than 6\" from your unit\n\nFor the rest of the phase, attacks against that second unit also get -1 to their Hit rolls.",
